OL,3,GNEWSAMother, grandmother and stepfather
OL,4,Asentenced for 'house of terror' abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother, grandmother and stepfather
OL,7,Fwho subjected three children to years
OL,8,Fof abuse in a "house of terror" have
OL,9,Favoided jail.
OL,11,FShirley Freeman, Julia Stephen and
OL,12,FDavid McColl's victims were beaten,
OL,13,Fstarved and psychologically tormented
OL,14,Fbetween 2003 and 2012.
OL,16,FFreeman, 51, and Stephen, 69, were
OL,17,Fearlier found guilty of cruel and
OL,18,Funnatural treatment. McColl, 50,
OL,19,Fadmitted the crimes.
